1-30|Nothing of significance (besides clothes and other obvious gear).
31-40|Coppers equal to the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll.
41-50|Coppers equal to 20 + the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll.
51-60|Silvers equal to the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll.
61-75|Silvers equal to 20 + the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll.
76-85|Silvers equal to 40 + the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll.
86-95|Silvers equal to the sum of the digits on the [[d100]] roll, plus Precious Stone worth 100 sp + the highest d10 roll. The lower die determines gem type: (i) Quartz, (ii) Agate, (iii) Amber (iv) Turquoise, (v) Crystal, (vi) Amethyst, (vii) Jasper, (viii) Topaz, (ix) Jade, (x) Pearl.
96-100|Roll [[3d20]] on the Carry Loot B table.